 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Tier shelf, eight kinds kept as planned (k25–k32), 5–9 models each. Vornado air-circulator SKU list cut from 12 to 3 (630, 660, 533); 783 moved to Pedestal fan as a stand circulator; 6803 OSC kept, EOS 9S, EOS 9, 293, 753, MOVIO, OMNIO, STRATA, VFAN, VORA and ARA dropped as SKU noise. Bladeless (Dyson) handled as a type under desk, tower and pedestal fans. Added Dyson, Lasko, Honeywell, Rowenta, Balmuda, Xiaomi/Smartmi, Meaco, Duux, Dreo, Shark, JisuLife, Torras, Francfranc, Hurricane; Bionaire, Momcozy, Skip Hop, Swan, Levoit appear as model makers but have no register entry (no brand page retrieved). Iris Ohyama WOOZOO kept as a range (no model page retrieved). Misting and outdoor fans (Shark FlexBreeze misting, Dreo 765S) left to C2 Garden; ceiling, extractor and whole-house fans to G3. Independent test picks: TechRadar (Dreo 519S, Dyson CF1, MeacoFan 1056P, Shark TurboBlade/FlexBreeze/ChillPill, Dyson HushJet), Trusted Reviews (MeacoFan 650/1056, Swan Retro, Duux Whisper Flex Smart), The Bump (stroller fans). Sources: Wikipedia (wiki tool) and maker/retailer pages retrieved this session; Wikidata search returned nothing for Lasko so lasko.com/about was used. Founding year left blank where no retrieved page stated it. No traditions apply.",
